const result = await architect({
  task: `Bug fix review: the 育児日記 (parenting diary) feature could not be saved — users got "保存に失敗しました".

Root cause: the diary endpoints (GET/POST/PATCH/DELETE /api/diaries) were the ONLY write endpoints that required a server login session (req.session.userId). The rest of this app has no server session for normal use — it identifies the user by a client-provided userId of "papa"/"mama" plus familyId (e.g. POST /api/logs takes userId from the request body, no session). In the Replit preview (and likely the native app being migrated to), the user is not LINE-authenticated, so req.session.userId is undefined and every diary write returned 401.

Fix: aligned the diary feature with the app-wide identity model (userId = "papa"/"mama" from localStorage userType + familyId), removing the hard session requirement.
- Server (server/routes.ts diary routes): resolve userId from req.body.userId / req.query.userId, falling back to session. GET no longer 401s; POST requires a resolved userId (400 if missing) and stores it; PATCH/DELETE do ownership checks against the resolved userId.
- Client (client/src/pages/Diary.tsx): sends userId (userType) on the list query, POST/PATCH payload, and DELETE body; ownership (isMine, edit/delete buttons) now compares entry.userId === userType. Removed the old /api/auth/me-based myId.

The privacy model must still hold: getDiaryEntriesForUser returns shared entries + the requester's own private entries; partner must NOT see the other's private entries.

I verified via curl: POST (no session) saves; GET as papa sees own private; GET as mama does NOT see papa's private.

Please review for: (1) correctness of the new identity resolution and that the shared/private privacy model is preserved; (2) any security concern introduced by dropping the session requirement (note: this app already trusts client userId/familyId everywhere — two cooperating parents per family is the threat model); (3) any regression in the diary CRUD flow. Focus on severe issues only.`,
  relevantFiles: [
    "server/routes.ts:1346-1413",
    "server/storage.ts:727-760",
    "client/src/pages/Diary.tsx",
    "client/src/lib/queryClient.ts",
  ],
  includeGitDiff: true,
  responsibility: "evaluate_task",
});
console.log(result.result);

